# Component File Layout

Every UI component must use this structure:

```
ComponentName/
├── componentName.tsx
├── componentName.styles.ts
├── componentName.utils.ts
├── componentName.constants.ts
├── componentName.types.ts
├── componentName.context.tsx
└── components/
```

- `componentName.tsx`: Main rendering & composition
- `componentName.styles.ts`: Tailwind + CVA styles
- `componentName.utils.ts`: Utilities scoped to this component
- `componentName.constants.ts`: Constant values scoped here
- `componentName.types.ts`: Types scoped to this component
- `componentName.context.tsx`: Local context to prevent prop drilling
- `/components/`: Subcomponents used only here
